  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "躲着老大与相亲消息  (Dodging the Boss and Dating News)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still chatting after the crew's return, Kaiwen notices Bu Xiaogu is nowhere in sight and compares notes with Xingzi over dinner about Chun Yuqiao's gloomy mood abroad. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷那丫头呢？咱们回来了她也没过来，还在躲着老大呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "有进步啊你，连你也看出来小谷躲着老大呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这谁看不出来呀？感情这事不走心没意思，太走心了又太累。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷跟老大这种做什么事都那么认真的人，难免会纠结。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你就当我刚才什么都没说，千万别不理我啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "行，我理你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一个男人要是被自己喜欢的女人躲着，那感觉太难受了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这次在欧洲见老大每天生无可恋的样子，真是太让人心疼了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷这孩子还是年轻，处理感情不够成熟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们俩这样真是急死我了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们小谷现在没时间想这个，正忙着人生大事呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "啥人生大事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "忙着相亲恋爱啊！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷那丫头呢？咱们回来了她也没过来，还在躲着老大呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where is Xiaogu? We are back and she has not shown up—is she still dodging the boss?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "有进步啊你，连你也看出来小谷躲着老大呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at you making progress—even you noticed Xiaogu has been avoiding the boss?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这谁看不出来呀？感情这事不走心没意思，太走心了又太累。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who could miss it? In romance, not caring is dull, yet caring too deeply is exhausting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷跟老大这种做什么事都那么认真的人，难免会纠结。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'People like Xiaogu and the boss who take everything so seriously are bound to get tangled up inside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你就当我刚才什么都没说，千万别不理我啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just pretend I said nothing at all just now—please do not give me the silent treatment!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "行，我理你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fine, I will talk to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一个男人要是被自己喜欢的女人躲着，那感觉太难受了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When a man gets avoided by the woman he likes, that feeling is awful.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这次在欧洲见老大每天生无可恋的样子，真是太让人心疼了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Seeing the boss look utterly joyless every day in Europe really made my heart ache.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷这孩子还是年轻，处理感情不够成熟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu is still young and not yet mature when handling feelings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们俩这样真是急死我了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Watching the two of them like this is driving me crazy with worry!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们小谷现在没时间想这个，正忙着人生大事呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our Xiaogu has no time to dwell on that right now; she is busy with a major life milestone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "啥人生大事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What major life milestone?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "忙着相亲恋爱啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Going on blind dates and dating!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷那丫头呢？咱们回来了她也没过来，还在躲着老大呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
